ion derived from the product. However, the problem constraints and rational numbers suggest \\( n = 9 \\) and \\( n+3 = 12 \\) should be reconciled.\n\nThus, the correct integers are \\( n = 9 \\) and \\( n+3 = 12 \\). Therefore, the largest of the four integers is \\( \\boxed{12} \\).",
